-- src/eval/journal/witness_live_test.ail
--
-- PLAN-004 M11, the run-bearing half (A7, A8, the census), on real admission
-- runs over synthetic journal worlds. A runner, as admission_live_test.ail:
--
--   ailang run --caps IO,Env,FS,AI,Process,Net,SharedMem,Clock,Stream,Trace,Rand \
--     --ai-stub --entry main src/eval/journal/witness_live_test.ail < /dev/null
--
-- One `PASS <check>` / `FAIL <check>` line per check; exit 1 on any failure.
--
--   m11_t0_suspended_clean / m11_t0_finalize_clean
--     m3_selector_end (EndSuspended(3)) and m4_stop_call_last
--     (EndFinalize(model_stop)) through `admit_with_evidence`: report clean
--     with A7/A8 included; the witness (prepared calls, queue consumption,
--     clock delta, route zeros, each env key's count with T); the bridge
--     inputs (NoReplay, budget = 2N+1 / 2N = the DecisionRecord count, retry
--     0, metadata = replay_metadata_of(manifest)); `evaluate` empty;
--     family_evidence recorded unchanged, ReplayConsistency the only
--     unevaluated family, CheckpointHistory evaluated-but-vacuous; every
--     census count zero by name (decisions and the Finalize manifest read at
--     their expectations).
--   m11_witness_under_over
--     the suspended run with one ProviderCallPrepared added (under-count) or
--     dropped (over-count), and with a tool left in the final queue.
--   m11_profile_missed_models_file_refused
--     m5_config_missed_{unknown,non_positive,no_event}: the run reads
--     MOTOKO_MODELS_FILE; admission's first finding is
--     A7:EnvReadOverRecorded@aggregate:witness on that key (then MOTOKO_REPO).
--   m11_fault_path_own_column
--     the suspended world with its last step removed: call 3 fails
--     non-retryably and the run reads MOTOKO_CAPTURE_FAILED_PAYLOAD once.
--     The fault column balances it; the accepted column refuses it; the
--     census counts it (capture_reads 1).
--   m11_wrong_obligation_or_metadata
--     the bridge built with StrictAgainst(log), with another manifest's
--     metadata, with unknown metadata, with another epoch: each its own A8
--     finding; StrictAgainst turns ReplayConsistency evaluated; any other
--     unevaluated family is FamilyUnevaluated.
--   m11_decision_budget
--     budget N instead of 2N+1: DecisionBudgetDiffers, and `evaluate` then
--     reports decision-budget-exceeded; retry 1: RetryBudgetNonZero; a
--     DecisionRecord dropped from the trace: DecisionCountMismatch.
--   m11_census_twins_live
--     on the suspended run, one non-zero twin per census count, each moving
--     its own count (and a decision twin the decision total too).
--
-- Synthetic fixtures only (§0.6).

module src/eval/journal/witness_live_test

